# ADR (always on)

Read `.agents/skills/adr/SKILL.md` when starting feature or structural work.

During work: if the change needs an ADR, create or update it in plain prose as decisions land, not only before commit.

Before commit: confirm the ADR matches the diff, stage it with the code. Commit body: `ADR-NNNN: one-line summary`.
